Cell[TextData[{
 "Comparing now to our computation using the residual stress-energy.\n",
 StyleBox["Note:",
  FontColor->RGBColor[0, 0, 1]],
 " Checked that this holds, when using a power-series expansion of the \
puncture (and therefore of the stress energy); see Archive section. Found \
agreement to be independent of ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SubscriptBox["r", "min"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "1499a5af-ffba-4911-a03d-0d9e15b99661"],
 " and ",
