  3.873818253632366*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"46cd95a6-8f19-488f-9319-\
cbc1cc7aea0d"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "According to ",
 ButtonBox["2101.04592",
  BaseStyle->"Hyperlink",
  ButtonData->{
    URL["https://arxiv.org/pdf/2101.04592.pdf"], None},
  ButtonNote->"https://arxiv.org/pdf/2101.04592.pdf"],
 " Table 1 at page 29. Note that the tetrad in the table is for Carter! So, \
need to convert to Kinnersley.\nAlso, inverted the BLS indices 3 and 6, \
because the puncture is given in trace-reversed form.\nBy inspection of the \
puncture, they satisfy ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    SubscriptBox["h", 
     RowBox[{"il", "-", "m"}]], " ", "=", " ", 
    RowBox[{
     SuperscriptBox[
      RowBox[{"(", 
       RowBox[{"-", "1"}], ")"}], "m"], 
     SubsuperscriptBox["h", "ilm", "*"]}]}], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "ec09b7db-83b0-4997-b2cc-faf7ac0d278b"],
 "."
}], "Text",
 Evaluatable->False,
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.872755156919907*^9, 3.872755221618581*^9}, {
   3.8727553624607153`*^9, 3.8727553862978067`*^9}, {3.8727604358840923`*^9, 
   3.872760486905448*^9}, 3.872929285426695*^9, 3.8729298123637867`*^9, {
   3.873819556363809*^9, 3.8738195645708942`*^9}, {3.876827139133045*^9, 
   3.876827165524076*^9}, {3.8768282237125063`*^9, 3.876828224141883*^9}, {
   3.881136164020965*^9, 3.881136270655615*^9}, {3.886152784752035*^9, 
   3.886152799957592*^9}, {3.890891639083684*^9, 
   3.890891664849866*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"efd44cfa-8e83-49a3-b8fa-\
fa8abf78f1f9"],

