 ".\n",
 "Similarly, for contribution at ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SubscriptBox["r", "max"], TraditionalForm]],
  FontWeight->"Plain",
  FontVariations->{"Underline"->False},ExpressionUUID->
  "467f14ec-3736-4a81-8bd9-f6afef4c5f6b"],
 ", ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{"H", "(", 
    RowBox[{"r", "-", 
     SubscriptBox["r", "max"]}], ")"}], TraditionalForm]],
  FontWeight->"Plain",
  FontVariations->{"Underline"->False},ExpressionUUID->
  "81e06b40-9a96-4c43-8223-640837ced20c"],
 " means most integrals vanish. In fact, only term that survives is the \
\[OpenCurlyDoubleQuote]boundary term\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote] coming from \
\[Delta]\[CloseCurlyQuote]. \n",
